---
// Shown on every page when site.regulated is true (therapy, medical and other clinical practices).
---
<aside class="crisis" aria-label="Emergency help">
  <p class="wrap">
    In crisis? Call or text <a href="tel:988">988</a> (Suicide and Crisis Lifeline) or call
    <a href="tel:911">911</a>. This site isn't monitored for emergencies.
  </p>
</aside>

<style>
  .crisis { background: var(--color-alert-bg); color: var(--color-alert-text); }
  .crisis p { margin: 0; padding-block: var(--space-2); max-width: none; }
  .crisis a { color: var(--color-alert-text); font-weight: 700; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 1.5rem; }
</style>
